%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE — "全書一句話" spread built on the letter's
%% own resolution in chapter 15: not rules first, but resurrection
%% first — the single root beneath all sixteen chapters' problems.
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterPurple} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Sentence}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{TextGray}
\textbf{\color{JesusRed}基督若沒有復活}，你們的信便是徒然，你們仍在罪裏……\\
但基督已經從死人中復活，成為睡了之人\textbf{\color{JesusRed}初熟的果子}。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
And if Christ has not been raised, your faith is futile and you are still in your sins...\\
But in fact Christ has been raised from the dead, the \textbf{\color{JesusRed}firstfruits} of those who have fallen asleep.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterPurple} 哥林多前書 15:17, 20 \textperiodcentered\ 1 Corinthians 15:17, 20
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 不是先講規條，是先講復活——十六章看似十六個不同的問題，根子只有一個。\\
\textit{Not rules first, but resurrection first — sixteen chapters, sixteen different problems, one single root.}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{4.0cm}p{2.6cm}p{4.2cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{問題 Problem} & \textbf{根源 Root Cause} & \textbf{解答 The Answer} \\
\midrule
分裂、淫亂、告狀、恩賜驕傲 \newline {\scriptsize\itshape division, immorality, lawsuits, pride in gifts} & 不信復活 \newline {\scriptsize\itshape disbelief in the resurrection} & 十字架的道理，復活的確據 \newline {\scriptsize\itshape the word of the cross, the certainty of resurrection} \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterPurple} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
每一章的問題都不一樣，但保羅每次都把讀者帶回同一個地方——\\
十字架、復活、基督是我們的一切。\\
讀這封信，不要只停在「保羅在糾正什麼」，\\
要問：這個問題的根，是不是因為忘記了復活的盼望？\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
Each chapter's problem looks different, but Paul keeps leading the reader back to the same place —\\
the cross, the resurrection, Christ as our everything.\\
Don't just ask what Paul is correcting;\\
ask whether the root is a forgotten hope of resurrection.}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

