\chapter*{Appendix E: A Reading Plan for 1 Corinthians 哥林多前書讀經計劃}
\addcontentsline{toc}{chapter}{Appendix E: A Reading Plan for 1 Corinthians 哥林多前書讀經計劃}

\section*{十六日讀經計劃 A Sixteen-Day Plan (一天一章 One Chapter a Day)}

\begin{small}
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.25}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{1.3cm}p{2.3cm}p{3.0in}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{天 Day} & \textbf{經文 Passage} & \textbf{焦點 Focus} \\
\midrule
1 & 1:1-31 & 教會的呼召與分裂問題 \textit{The Church's Calling and Division} \\
2 & 2:1-16 & 十字架的智慧 \textit{The Wisdom of the Cross} \\
3 & 3:1-23 & 屬靈與屬肉體 \textit{Spiritual vs Carnal} \\
4 & 4:1-21 & 基督的執事 \textit{Servants of Christ} \\
5 & 5:1-13 & 教會紀律 \textit{Church Discipline} \\
6 & 6:1-20 & 聖潔的身體 \textit{The Holy Body} \\
7 & 7:1-40 & 婚姻與獨身 \textit{Marriage and Singleness} \\
8 & 8:1-13 & 祭偶像之物與良心 \textit{Food Offered to Idols and Conscience} \\
9 & 9:1-27 & 使徒的權柄與榜樣 \textit{The Apostle's Rights and Example} \\
10 & 10:1-33 & 以色列的鑑戒 \textit{Warnings from Israel's History} \\
11 & 11:1-34 & 敬拜的秩序 \textit{Order in Worship} \\
12 & 12:1-31 & 屬靈恩賜 \textit{Spiritual Gifts} \\
13 & 13:1-13 & 愛的真諦 \textit{The Way of Love} \\
14 & 14:1-40 & 方言與先知講道 \textit{Tongues and Prophecy} \\
15 & 15:1-58 & 復活的盼望與榮耀身體 \textit{The Hope of Resurrection and the Glorious Body} \\
16 & 16:1-24 & 結語與問安 \textit{Closing Remarks and Greetings} \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{small}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\section*{四週讀經計劃 A Compressed Four-Week Plan (小組查經適用 For Group Study)}

\begin{small}
若時間有限，可將十六章壓縮為四週查經，每週四章：\\
\textit{For those with limited time, the sixteen chapters may be compressed into a four-week group study, four chapters per week:}
\end{small}

\vspace{0.2cm}

\begin{small}
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.25}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{1.6cm}p{1.6cm}p{3.3in}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{週 Week} & \textbf{經文 Passage} & \textbf{焦點 Focus} \\
\midrule
第一週 & 1-4章 & 呼召、智慧、根基、執事 \textit{Calling, wisdom, foundation, stewardship} \\
第二週 & 5-8章 & 紀律、聖潔、婚姻、良心 \textit{Discipline, holiness, marriage, conscience} \\
第三週 & 9-12章 & 權柄、鑑戒、秩序、恩賜 \textit{Rights, warning, worship order, gifts} \\
第四週 & 13-16章 & 愛、方言與講道、復活、問安 \textit{Love, tongues and prophecy, resurrection, greetings} \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{small}

